# SPAKE2+ Prover key-share known-answer tests with a fixed ephemeral scalar,
# injected through the MBEDTLS_TEST_HOOKS-only seam
# mbedtls_spake2p_write_key_share_with_ephemeral().
#
# Arguments: curve, hash, mac, context, idProver, idVerifier, client key
# (w0||w1), x, expected shareP.
#
# Every row is an official RFC 9383 Appendix C test vector (trusted, third
# party): the HMAC ciphersuites the RFC defines over P-256/P-384/P-521.

SPAKE2+ Prover key-share KAT P-256 HMAC-SHA256 (RFC 9383 Appendix C)
depends_on:MBEDTLS_ECP_DP_SECP256R1_ENABLED:PSA_WANT_ALG_SHA_256
