# SPAKE2+ CMAC confirmation known-answer tests (issue #9377). Identical to the
# HMAC handshake except the confirmation MAC is AES-CMAC-128 instead of
# HMAC-Hash (RFC 9383 Section 3.4); the KDF stays HKDF. The vectors are the
# RFC 9383 Appendix C P256-SHA256-HKDF-SHA256-CMAC-AES-128-SHA256 ciphersuite.

# The rows mirror the HMAC unit-KAT set: key-share and transcript-prefix
# KATs are MAC-independent computations, but running them under the CMAC
# ciphersuite pins the vector 6 published values end to end.

SPAKE2+ Prover key-share KAT P-256 CMAC-AES-128 (RFC 9383 Appendix C)
