# RFC 9383 Appendix C P256-SHA512-HKDF-SHA512-CMAC-AES-128 (vector 7):
# the digest (SHA-512) is larger than the curve size, so w0 in TT is shorter
# than the digest -- the only CMAC suite exercising that key-schedule path.
